{"speciesId":501,"names":{"fr":"Moustillon","es":"Oshawott","en":"Oshawott","ja":"ミジュマル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il combat avec le coupillage de son ventre. Il peut parer un assaut et immédiatement contre-attaquer."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It fights using the scalchop on its stomach. In response to an attack, it retaliates immediately by slashing."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le coupillage sur son ventre est fait de la même matière que ses griffes. Il le détache pour l’utiliser comme une dague."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The scalchop on its stomach is made from the same elements as claws. It detaches the scalchop for use as a blade."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The scalchop on its stomach isn’t just used for battle--it can be used to break open hard berries as well."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The scalchop on its stomach isn’t just used for battle--it can be used to break open hard berries as well."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Le coupillage sur son ventre lui sert non seulement à combattre, mais aussi à trancher les Baies très dures."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"La vieira de su ombligo no solo sirve como arma, sino también como instrumento para cortar las bayas que estén duras."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The scalchop on its stomach isn’t just used for battle--it can be used to break open hard berries as well."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"お腹に できる ホタチは 戦うとき だけでなく 硬い 木の実を 割るときにも 使う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il combat avec le coupillage de son ventre. Il peut parer un assaut et immédiatement contre-attaquer."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Ataca con la vieira de su ombligo. En cuanto para un ataque, pasa al contraataque sin dilación."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It fights using the scalchop on its stomach. In response to an attack, it retaliates immediately by slashing."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"お腹の ホタチで 戦う。 攻撃を 受け止めてから すかさず 切りつけて 反撃するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le coupillage sur son ventre lui sert non seulement à combattre, mais aussi à trancher les Baies très dures."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La vieira de su ombligo no solo sirve como arma, sino también como instrumento para cortar las bayas que estén duras."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The scalchop on its stomach isn’t just used for battle—it can be used to break open hard berries as well."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"お腹に できる ホタチは 戦うとき だけでなく 硬い 木の実を 割るときにも 使う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il combat avec le coupillage de son ventre. Il peut parer un assaut et immédiatement contre-attaquer."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ataca con la vieira de su ombligo. En cuanto para un ataque, pasa al contraataque sin dilación."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It fights using the scalchop on its stomach. In response to an attack, it retaliates immediately by slashing."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"お腹の ホタチで 戦う。 攻撃を 受け止めてから すかさず 切りつけて 反撃するのだ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"This Pokémon from the Unova region uses the shell on its belly as a weapon to cut down its foes. Thus, I've conferred upon this shell the name ”scalchop”."}],"varieties":[{"id":501,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[11,"level-up",41],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",41],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",41],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",41],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",41],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",41],[18,"machine",0],[24,"level-up",11],[25,"level-up",41],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1]